From 489c202c7d9b78599f5aeb7e8931e48c327e402e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rpc: add Boost.Asio coroutine HTTP/RPC dispatcher and migrate
 long-polling

Replace the blocking HTTP work queue with a C++20 Boost.Asio coroutine
thread pool and non-blocking steady_timer long-poll waiters.

Original-Commit: 547716de2b356ab993ff956ee5a559a24600d88a
Original-Patch: ecash/013
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.
